WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.510
In this last scenario,

00:00:01.510 --> 00:00:05.750
you're creating a mobile web app called
vicarious concerts for people who like

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:09.660
to compare concert videos shot by
random people in the audience.

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:11.590
Each video takes a few seconds to load,
so

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:15.920
you decide to show a spinning
record icon, like this one.

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:18.100
In place of each video
while it's loading.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:23.200
Should you use an animated .gif or
an animated SVG for this record icon?

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:24.660
And should you inline the spinner, or

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:27.140
should you set its srcs
to an external file?

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:28.530
Answer both questions to continue.

